| 1 | [1,2] | No | Union | ❌ |
| 2 | [2,3] | No | Union | ❌ |
| 3 | [3,4] | No | Union | ❌ |
| 4 | [1,4] | Yes (1 & 4 already connected) | Return [1,4] | ✅ |

Output → `[1,4]`

